   "raw": "Bearconnect 2.0",
   "rendered": "Bearconnect 2.0"
  },
  "content": {
   "raw": "<p>Bearconnect started as a LinkedIn outreach tool. With V2, it’s now a platform for both inbound and outbound on LinkedIn. Create and schedule content, find prospects from LinkedIn activity, and turn intent into conversations with AI-powered messaging. V2 also adds team workspaces, role-based access, Brand Voice, CRM integrations, and webhooks.</p>\n",
